Low Density Housing - Addition / Alteration - HRC - Exterior and interior alteration to this existing SFD. Scope of work to include:
- new exterior cladding to replace all existing cladding;
- interior layout changes to both main and upper level;
- replace some windows and doors; and,
- repairs to existing roof as needed. 

Revision #1: Gas fireplace previously proposed is cancelled. Infill existing door from foyer to living room and make a new opening from living to kitchen. New exterior rear door in kitchen. New guest bath and master W.I.C. No Project Value added. Sch C-B (Jason Hui, 778-319-3409) & C-D provided (Sunil Bhanot, 604-575-8220) provided.
